{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026OCrRCGesWV1793278118.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>湖北武漢地鐵12號線全線通車，是亞洲最長的地鐵環狀線。</p><p></p><p>周四通車日不少乘客率先乘搭。新開通的12號線二期，連同五月開通的一期，合併成全長59.9公里的環線。中新社報道指，長度是世界第二、亞洲第一。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.SUBWAY-1800_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026DQvXpwGpfz1793278126.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>全線設有37個地下車站，串聯7個中心城區，銜接漢口、武昌站兩大鐵路樞紐，可轉乘18條現有及規劃線路。全程車程大約1.5小時。</p><p></p><p>12號線穿越長江及漢江，因此全面貫通後，將進一步打破長江及漢江天然阻隔的跨江通勤問題。</p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T13:01:13.087539+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":205,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T11:54:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T13:18:22.573311+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T12:58:26.040451+00:00","content_hash":"9d11bdbaae6c61f694d0cc2a53746db8838569c3a1669a1090950358ed629317","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T13:01:13.087539+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}